  <item>
    <title>Vol6.33 民族的世界的宇宙的｜被送往太空的小众民族音乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6701656781cdab3a93f1ad75</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6701656781cdab3a93f1ad75</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 16:12:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>α星系的听众朋友们大家好，莫比乌斯环音乐广播将继续为您带来地球飞行器“旅行者号”所携带的声音信息。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目中，您将听到地球人类精选出的代表多个地区、多个民族的音乐，其中既有雅正冲淡的古琴曲《流水》，也有为庆祝女孩月经而歌唱的刚果俾格米女子成人曲；有寄寓着迁徙与漂泊的阿塞拜疆风笛，也有刚劲雄浑的格鲁吉亚复调民谣……它们丰富、朴拙而真挚，是从高山到平原、南半球到北半球、不同信仰、不同历史的人群对美与生活的礼赞。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期，你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 流水，乐之“德”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 刚果俾格米女子的成人礼歌，古老部落中的性别平等意识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a> 秘鲁婚礼歌，海拔3500米的憧憬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a> 打败了德彪西的排箫与风笛曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 查科鲁罗，什么样的音乐能代表俄罗斯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 花的种类，音乐精灵从青铜中显现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1788">29:48</a> 编钟，穿越时间的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵流水-管平湖</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Alima Song-Mbuti of the Ituri Rainforest</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Wedding Song-young girl from Huancavelica, recorded by John Cohen</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Roncadoras and Drums-Musicians from Ancash</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Clair de Lune (Claude Debussy)-Maria João Pires</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Muğam-Kamil Jalilov</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Chakrulo-by Georgian State Merited Ensemble of Folk Song and Dance</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵Ketawang: Puspåwarnå (Kinds of Flowers)-by Pura Paku Alaman Palace Orchestra/K.R.T. Wasitodipuro</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵楚商调-湖北编钟乐团</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵El Cascabel-Antonio Maciel and Los Aguilillas with Mariachi México de Pepe Villa/Rafael Carrión</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 主播简介 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>西西：刚回归科研的科研人员</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑土：想写科幻小说但一直没写成的纪录片人</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 订阅我们 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的节目在每个很2的日子更新，每个月更新3次。如果大家喜欢这一期的内容，请多多留言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家关注我们：小宇宙｜荔枝FM｜喜马拉雅｜Apple播客｜网易云音乐</span></p>]]></description>
